; The variable is the trail of a GPUParticles3D: three particles fly along a curved path, and each
; draws a trail through the sections of its mesh. Left, a RibbonTrailMesh whose material sets
; use_particle_trails, so it bends along the path. Middle, a TubeTrailMesh with the same flag. Right,
; a RibbonTrailMesh whose material does not set it, so every section draws the whole ribbon. No
; other golden shows a trail: the other emitters draw no trail.
